Spawn an independent worker process. By default uses a built-in agent with {tools} tools. The worker only sees the task description you provide — no conversation history.{opencode_note}{acp_note}

If a code worker is enabled and the task is coding-heavy (multi-file edits, debugging, refactors), set `worker_type` accordingly and include the required `directory` plus `acp_profile_id` for ACP workers.
